      "originalText": "Graph describes structure and historical beliefs; it never estimates.\nA method estimates only on eligible typed evidence; it never executes writes.\nA certificate qualifies a specified estimand, not every mechanism edge.\nThe shell owns transactions and permissions, not causal truth.",
